   718	                                                                   single_thread):
   719	    """Draws are per (conditioner forward x coordinate) — the real DINO topology.
   720	
   721	    The loop took ``C * K`` draws per conditioner and gave every angle its own;
   722	    the batched path takes ``(1 + n_chunks) * K`` and shares each within a chunk.
   723	    Both facts are pinned here, per ViT id, with its own coordinate count."""
   724	    n_ctx = 2                                    # _small_md's context count
